# The captured request fixture is deliberately `.log`, not `.json`: it is
# concatenated JSON objects rather than a JSON document, so the extension keeps
# formatters and parsers off it. Both this repo's root .gitignore and the
# vite:library scaffold ignore `*.log`, so it has to be un-ignored explicitly.
!src/fixtures/*.capture.log
